WEBVTT

00:00:00.950 --> 00:00:02.660
Come with me.

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:08.060
The Seven-Light Faith will accept 
those sentiments you and the Count shared.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:16.340
For the ideals of Count Blumhardt 
that dwell within this sword,

00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:19.490
and for my own sake as well,

00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:22.500
I shall accompany you.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.010
Yeah!

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:28.000
Hide!

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:33.580
<i>That's Count Conrad.</i>

00:00:33.580 --> 00:00:35.010
<i>Also...</i>

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:40.280
<i>That can't be!</i>

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:48.570
Well, Tanganika,

00:00:48.570 --> 00:00:52.900
it's a wonderful, dazzling sight, isn't it?

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:56.120
You broke the statue?

00:00:56.780 --> 00:00:57.850
Yes,

00:00:57.850 --> 00:01:03.450
there aren't any merchants who could convert 
such a huge mass of pure gold into coin,

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:06.250
and with the statue taking 
the shape of the emperor,

00:01:06.250 --> 00:01:08.260
it was hard to pawn off.

00:01:08.690 --> 00:01:10.460
I see.

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:12.100
You broke it.

00:01:12.920 --> 00:01:15.160
Rommel von Conrad.

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:20.180
Since His Majesty desires competition 
and the survival of the fittest,

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:23.930
I will not reproach you for betraying me.

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:26.400
However,

00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:31.120
to take a hammer and smash 
apart a statue bearing even

00:01:31.120 --> 00:01:32.980
a poor resemblance of his majesty...

00:01:32.980 --> 00:01:35.390
A-Are you telling me you're...!

00:01:35.390 --> 00:01:37.820
Be ashamed of yourself,

00:01:37.820 --> 00:01:39.950
you foolish cur!

00:01:42.820 --> 00:01:44.230
Duke Gustave?!

00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:45.660
I thought you were dead?!

00:01:47.250 --> 00:01:48.780
As if I could die

00:01:48.780 --> 00:01:54.640
while poisonous insects that defy His Majesty
still roam free in his garden!

00:01:54.640 --> 00:02:01.690
With Neuro's secret arts, I have returned 
and brought the flames of hell with me!

00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:07.590
<i>Wh-What's that?!</i>

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:10.810
You poisonous insects.

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:13.440
Shoot! Run!

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:15.280
I won't let you escape!

00:02:21.990 --> 00:02:27.330
<b>It Seems High School Prodigies
\h\h\h\hHave It Easy Even In Another World!</b>

00:02:29.170 --> 00:02:30.800
Wh-What?!

00:02:35.990 --> 00:02:37.740
He's indiscriminate.

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:53.690
Micchan, we're in trouble!

00:02:54.080 --> 00:02:55.870
Gustave's still alive!

00:02:55.870 --> 00:02:59.700
He's gotten way more powerful than 
he was the last time we fought him,

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:03.830
and everyone inside of 
Uranus Castle is going up in his flames!

00:03:05.450 --> 00:03:08.450
Mhm, mhm, mhm...

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:09.480
Huh?!

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:10.960
You mean...

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:13.580
All right.

00:03:16.480 --> 00:03:17.530
Shinobu?

00:03:18.230 --> 00:03:19.340
Jeanne.

00:03:19.340 --> 00:03:20.750
We're picking up the pace.

00:03:20.750 --> 00:03:21.510
Yes!

00:03:32.630 --> 00:03:35.200
It boils! It seethes!

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:37.190
What powerful magic!

00:03:42.450 --> 00:03:48.330
With this power, I can fight for His Majesty
 even better than before!

00:03:48.330 --> 00:03:50.860
I will devote everything to His Majesty!

00:03:50.860 --> 00:03:53.330
Nothing could bring me more joy!

00:03:57.080 --> 00:03:59.800
You pests who dare defy His Majesty,

00:03:59.800 --> 00:04:01.970
it doesn't matter where you run!

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:08.350
I will burn away every last hair 
and every fragment of your bones!

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:17.160
With the L'age Soleil of my rage!

00:04:31.120 --> 00:04:34.090
The enormous Uranus Castle is...

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:40.820
Was Gustave always this powerful?

00:04:40.820 --> 00:04:42.440
There's nothing that can stop that...

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:43.370
You're mistaken.

00:04:43.370 --> 00:04:44.300
Huh?

00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:47.920
That's the power of our Seven-Light Faith.

00:04:47.920 --> 00:04:50.890
My friends in Dormundt did that.

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:53.940
From Dormundt?

00:04:54.690 --> 00:04:56.280
At the far north?

00:04:56.810 --> 00:04:58.650
The empire isn't the only one

00:04:58.650 --> 00:05:02.490
capable of launching an attack of mass 
destruction across several domains.

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:04.490
If we actually felt like it,

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:09.200
we could instantly wipe out
the imperial capital from Findolf.

00:05:09.200 --> 00:05:12.500
Using this, God's Thunderbolt.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:18.100
What is that?

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:19.790
The sky is changing color...

00:05:19.790 --> 00:05:22.960
That politician seriously 
launched the damn thing.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:26.070
Master, do you know what that is?

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:28.760
That's a beacon.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:30.320
A beacon?

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:31.190
Yeah.

00:05:31.730 --> 00:05:35.530
A signal that we've entered a new era.

00:05:36.400 --> 00:05:39.150
From this day forward, we won't 
just be earning gold coins,

00:05:39.550 --> 00:05:42.730
we'll be printing our own money.

00:05:42.730 --> 00:05:44.450
And lots of it.

00:05:44.450 --> 00:05:46.500
And that's lots of fun.

00:05:48.400 --> 00:05:51.410
Hit confirmed.

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:53.210
Then the operation's a success.

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:55.100
Thank you, Ringo.

00:05:55.560 --> 00:05:57.860
We've finished laying the 
groundwork to found our nation.

00:05:58.420 --> 00:05:59.500
Yeah...

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:01.590
Ringo-kun.

00:06:03.940 --> 00:06:07.770
This world's tactical magic, 
the spell that burned Dormundt...

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:11.300
That was a threat.

00:06:11.840 --> 00:06:15.150
A large enough threat that moving forward,

00:06:15.150 --> 00:06:18.820
we will need to forge a pact forbidding 
its use once we found our nation.

00:06:20.450 --> 00:06:23.040
However, in order to do that,

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:27.830
we have to first prove that we have either 
equal or greater destructive power ourselves.

00:06:28.230 --> 00:06:29.320
After all...

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:34.830
Diplomacy can only occur between equals.

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:36.360
With this,

00:06:36.360 --> 00:06:40.490
we've provided clear evidence of our power 
and our willingness to exact retribution.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:45.370
These facts will absolutely prove useful 
at the negotiating table with the empire.

00:06:46.360 --> 00:06:47.210
So...

00:06:51.330 --> 00:06:55.600
This power will definitely serve 
as a bridge to happiness

00:06:55.600 --> 00:06:57.810
for the people of this world.

00:06:59.860 --> 00:07:03.440
<i>Oh, now I see. Back then...</i>

00:07:03.970 --> 00:07:07.320
There's something I need you to do.

00:07:07.320 --> 00:07:10.840
<i>Tsukasa purposefully 
phrased his request that way,</i>

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:16.280
<i>so I could push all the 
responsibility onto him,</i>

00:07:16.280 --> 00:07:18.900
<i>so I would resent him for this...</i>

00:07:19.320 --> 00:07:20.580
<i>But he's also...</i>

00:07:21.570 --> 00:07:23.330
<i>beating himself up...</i>

00:07:23.910 --> 00:07:29.220
<i>for being so powerless that he had 
to resort to using this power.</i>

00:07:32.230 --> 00:07:34.730
I don't resent you.

00:07:35.260 --> 00:07:42.200
Because I know you're always working hard

00:07:42.930 --> 00:07:45.530
for the happiness of others.

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:47.260
Ringo...

00:07:50.580 --> 00:07:51.640
Thank you.

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:03.790
Hey, what are we gathering for today?

00:08:04.170 --> 00:08:05.530
I don't know.

00:08:05.530 --> 00:08:10.550
But the angels told everyone to 
gather here for something important.

00:08:13.430 --> 00:08:15.180
Everyone!

00:08:15.180 --> 00:08:17.930
You've done well to heed 
my call and gather here!

00:08:19.880 --> 00:08:20.940
Whoa!

00:08:20.940 --> 00:08:22.060
When did they...

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:27.940
Now, let us get started!

00:08:27.940 --> 00:08:29.750
Akatsuki!

00:08:30.320 --> 00:08:33.000
Today we have an important, divine message

00:08:33.000 --> 00:08:36.450
for all the people living 
under the Seven-Light Faith!

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:39.700
Angel Tsukasa, take the podium!

00:08:45.280 --> 00:08:48.240
As many of you are already aware,

00:08:48.240 --> 00:08:52.200
the Azure Brigade was attacked
by the empire a few days ago.

00:08:52.200 --> 00:08:54.470
In response to this heinous act,

00:08:55.010 --> 00:08:58.220
we took decisive action and unleashed 
God's Thunderbolt in retribution,

00:08:58.680 --> 00:09:01.800
successfully annihilating the enemy forces.

00:09:03.600 --> 00:09:04.570
Wow.

00:09:04.570 --> 00:09:05.480
Thereafter,

00:09:05.480 --> 00:09:08.510
we spoke with the Azure Brigade 
and reached an agreement

00:09:08.510 --> 00:09:13.750
surrendering rule over the land of 
Gustave to the Seven-Light Faith!

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:19.040
As of this moment, the Seven-Light 
Faith now holds sovereignty

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:26.250
over the empire's four northern lands: 
Findolf, Buchwald, Arclide, and Gustave!

00:09:26.620 --> 00:09:32.780
However, it is not the desire of the 
Seven-Light Faith to rule over you all.

00:09:32.780 --> 00:09:35.440
Our desire is for you all

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:39.020
to rule yourselves, with equality for all.

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:42.140
But to do that, you all need one thing!

00:09:42.590 --> 00:09:43.960
A nation!

00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:46.520
Not a nation like the Freyjagard Empire,

00:09:46.910 --> 00:09:49.650
where everything belongs to a single emperor,

00:09:49.650 --> 00:09:53.850
and a handful of nobles are allowed to 
take the reins and do as they please!

00:09:54.830 --> 00:09:59.530
But a nation owned by every individual 
living within its lands,

00:09:59.820 --> 00:10:02.410
where everyone is able to 
participate in statecraft—

00:10:02.920 --> 00:10:04.300
a republic!

00:10:04.910 --> 00:10:06.300
A republic?

00:10:06.300 --> 00:10:08.020
What's that?

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:11.890
I understand you all may be 
confused by the unfamiliar term.

00:10:11.890 --> 00:10:14.300
However, I'm sure you've 
all experienced it before.

00:10:14.850 --> 00:10:17.920
You know the absurdity of a handful 
of people holding command over you!

00:10:17.920 --> 00:10:19.840
You know how unreasonable 
it is for them to exploit

00:10:19.840 --> 00:10:24.060
not only your homes and your assets, 
but the lives of your precious families!

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:26.010
Are you willing to allow a world

00:10:26.010 --> 00:10:30.270
where such travesty could befall 
your children to continue?!

00:10:30.270 --> 00:10:31.810
Is that what you want to leave them?!

00:10:31.810 --> 00:10:33.390
Of course not!

00:10:33.390 --> 00:10:36.320
I never want to go through that again!

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:40.570
Then you all must rise and 
stand on your own feet!

00:10:41.280 --> 00:10:45.330
And, of course, we shall spare 
nothing to aid you in this course!

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:46.970
Akatsuki will help us?

00:10:47.450 --> 00:10:49.100
The angels, too?

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:52.080
Now, I ask of you all:

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:55.710
are you prepared to take responsibility

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:58.590
and defend your own freedom and equality?!

00:11:02.090 --> 00:11:04.350
Yeah!

00:11:04.760 --> 00:11:10.100
Are you prepared to fight to defend 
your rights and your dignity?!

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:14.060
Yeah!

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:24.490
Then as of this moment,

00:11:24.880 --> 00:11:30.440
the Seven-Light Faith proclaims this land
to be the new nation of the Elm Republic!

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:36.230
It can't be...

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:44.220
What's happening?!

00:11:49.000 --> 00:11:51.210
Evacuate the citizens, quickly!

00:11:59.050 --> 00:11:59.990
Stay calm!

00:12:00.250 --> 00:12:01.360
Don't panic!

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:21.670
Oslo El Gustave!

00:12:21.670 --> 00:12:24.620
His Majesty's enemies...

00:12:25.650 --> 00:12:29.140
Kill, kill...

00:12:29.400 --> 00:12:31.640
No human is that durable...

00:12:34.390 --> 00:12:36.090
Kill.

00:12:36.090 --> 00:12:39.000
Kill. Kill. Kill.

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.150
Kill!

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:01.250
What is that?

00:13:28.520 --> 00:13:33.000
Kill, kill, kill!

00:13:33.000 --> 00:13:34.790
Kill!

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:37.170
We'll handle this!

00:13:37.520 --> 00:13:39.560
Aoi, Shinobu!

00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:41.420
Target the gem on his chest!

00:13:41.960 --> 00:13:44.920
I sense really scary power emanating from it!

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:47.800
A truly inhumane form of malice!

00:13:48.210 --> 00:13:50.550
Destroy that gem!

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:52.310
Understood!

00:13:50.880 --> 00:13:52.310
Roger!

00:13:52.640 --> 00:13:56.560
Those who defy His Majesty, I kill!

00:13:58.310 --> 00:14:02.200
I burn to death!

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:29.300
Art of Strength: Foe Slaying Flash!

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.320
That's...

00:14:45.320 --> 00:14:46.570
Yikes!

00:15:29.990 --> 00:15:30.990
Tsukasa!

00:15:30.990 --> 00:15:31.990
Tsukasa!

00:16:00.820 --> 00:16:02.490
I see.

00:16:03.400 --> 00:16:06.420
So you're the leader.

00:16:07.120 --> 00:16:08.570
What do you mean?

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:10.790
Don't play dumb with me.

00:16:11.270 --> 00:16:13.580
It's plain to see.

00:16:14.680 --> 00:16:19.470
You have the eyes of a ridiculous impostor 
who struggles to save what he can

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:25.770
while understanding how powerless 
he is before the acts of man.

00:16:26.290 --> 00:16:29.630
How can you preach equality for all?

00:16:29.630 --> 00:16:32.800
Do you long to suffer even more,

00:16:32.800 --> 00:16:37.140
clinging to your stupid ideals when 
you know how sinful man can be?

00:16:37.140 --> 00:16:45.020
Don't you remember all that you lost
 trying to save the majority?

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:45.650
Be quiet!

00:16:46.080 --> 00:16:50.150
Don't get arrogant, you fake, common man.

00:16:50.150 --> 00:16:53.020
We cannot save man.

00:16:53.900 --> 00:16:56.840
Eventually, you too will come to understand.

00:16:56.840 --> 00:17:02.080
This world exists for 
that man, and him alone.

00:17:02.540 --> 00:17:08.950
You will see that there is a prodigy 
chosen by the heavens to rule.

00:17:10.300 --> 00:17:12.190
And once you learn that,

00:17:12.190 --> 00:17:16.740
you will kneel before
 His Imperial Majesty on your own!

00:17:50.690 --> 00:17:51.840
Lady Kaguya.

00:17:54.740 --> 00:17:57.400
A dawn wind blows.

00:17:59.650 --> 00:18:00.600
Hibari...

00:18:01.810 --> 00:18:02.850
Shura...

00:18:07.000 --> 00:18:08.980
The world is changing.

00:18:12.290 --> 00:18:13.190
Hmm.

00:18:13.690 --> 00:18:16.520
No mercy at all.

00:18:18.050 --> 00:18:21.140
That power isn't from this world.

00:18:21.990 --> 00:18:25.370
The Seven-Light Faith will be an obstacle.

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:38.970
Don't get arrogant, you fake, common man.

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:43.140
We cannot save man.

00:18:51.010 --> 00:18:52.410
A dream?

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:56.250
<i>I know.</i>

00:18:56.760 --> 00:18:58.630
<i>I am an impostor.</i>

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:01.270
<i>Merchant,</i>

00:19:01.610 --> 00:19:02.990
<i>Ringo,</i>

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:04.240
<i>Akatsuki,</i>

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:05.490
<i>Aoi,</i>

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:06.620
<i>Keine,</i>

00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:08.070
<i>Shinobu...</i>

00:19:09.940 --> 00:19:13.420
<i>They're all capable of 
things only they can do</i>

00:19:13.420 --> 00:19:15.700
<i>with methods only they can use.</i>

00:19:16.050 --> 00:19:17.530
<i>They're true prodigies,</i>

00:19:18.290 --> 00:19:20.010
<i>but I'm different.</i>

00:19:20.690 --> 00:19:23.710
<i>I'm just using methods anyone else could use</i>

00:19:23.710 --> 00:19:26.580
<i>to conduct politics in a way
anyone else could.</i>

00:19:28.040 --> 00:19:30.120
I'm not some superhuman.

00:19:33.810 --> 00:19:37.280
Eventually, you too will come to understand.

00:19:37.280 --> 00:19:43.280
You will see that there is a prodigy 
chosen by the heavens to rule.

00:19:43.920 --> 00:19:48.470
<i>He must have been referring to 
Emperor Lindworm von Freyjagard.</i>

00:19:50.530 --> 00:19:55.720
<i>I'm not a prodigy, so is it even 
possible for me to beat him?</i>

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:12.230
<b>Reconnoitering</b>

00:20:11.460 --> 00:20:13.550
Oh, this is...

00:20:13.550 --> 00:20:14.480
Oh, my.

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:16.350
How nostalgic!

00:20:16.350 --> 00:20:17.730
It is, indeed.

00:20:18.010 --> 00:20:19.740
What is this?

00:20:19.740 --> 00:20:21.470
It's not glass, and yet...

00:20:21.470 --> 00:20:22.990
It's see-through!

00:20:22.990 --> 00:20:24.830
It is see-through.

00:20:24.830 --> 00:20:26.740
It sure is see-through.

00:20:28.880 --> 00:20:30.500
Sorry I'm late.

00:20:32.430 --> 00:20:33.250
<i>Tsukasa!</i>

00:20:33.250 --> 00:20:34.840
<i>We've been waiting for you, bear!</i>

00:20:34.840 --> 00:20:36.250
<i>Have a look at that!</i>

00:20:37.360 --> 00:20:38.250
Oh?

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:40.250
Well, this is...

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:44.580
I haven't seen mayonnaise 
like this in a while.

00:20:45.260 --> 00:20:49.600
I had some spare time lately,

00:20:49.600 --> 00:20:51.270
so I tried making some.

00:20:51.270 --> 00:20:56.770
<i>The container is biodegradable, 
so it's good for the environment, too!</i>

00:20:56.770 --> 00:20:58.320
That's wonderful.

00:20:58.320 --> 00:20:59.800
Now!

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:00.780
<i>Bear?</i>

00:21:00.780 --> 00:21:03.530
I think it's about time 
to start preparations.

00:21:03.530 --> 00:21:06.740
We have a new batch of mayonnaise as well.

00:21:14.870 --> 00:21:19.040
Well, to Mayor Ulga's newly built home.

00:21:19.370 --> 00:21:20.300
Cheers!

00:21:20.300 --> 00:21:22.100
Cheers!

00:21:22.760 --> 00:21:26.970
Man, I feel so lucky to eat
your home cooking, Winona.

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:30.510
My, you sure know how to flatter, Masato!

00:21:33.700 --> 00:21:35.640
Today's bread is delicious!

00:21:35.640 --> 00:21:38.360
Aoi helped make it this time.

00:21:38.710 --> 00:21:39.840
Right?

00:21:39.840 --> 00:21:42.900
Yes, I kneaded the dough!

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:49.030
You sure love mayonnaise, Roo.

00:21:49.310 --> 00:21:50.410
Yeah!

00:21:50.410 --> 00:21:52.720
I like it second to money!

00:21:54.410 --> 00:21:56.660
W-Wow, really?

00:21:58.670 --> 00:22:00.250
Wait, Roo!

00:22:00.250 --> 00:22:03.200
You're putting on way too much there!

00:22:03.200 --> 00:22:07.550
Mayonnaise tastes better 
when there's a lot of it!

00:22:08.740 --> 00:22:10.260
Right?

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:12.470
Nin-nin!

00:22:15.350 --> 00:22:18.100
U-Um, Tsukasa?

00:22:19.820 --> 00:22:22.440
What is it, you two?

00:22:22.440 --> 00:22:26.190
Oh, nothing. You go first, Ringo.

00:22:26.600 --> 00:22:29.820
Lyrule, you go first.

00:22:31.820 --> 00:22:34.060
All right, I will...

00:22:35.050 --> 00:22:37.410
Tsukasa, have some honey!

00:22:37.410 --> 00:22:40.570
It's good to eat sweet things 
when you're worn out.

00:22:42.130 --> 00:22:44.010
This too, if you'd like...

00:22:47.090 --> 00:22:49.750
Thank you both.

00:22:51.730 --> 00:22:54.570
<i>Why am I growing faint of heart?</i>

00:22:55.290 --> 00:22:59.610
<i>I'm surrounded by friends, 
just like I've always been.</i>

00:23:00.200 --> 00:23:01.610
<i>That alone is enough</i>

00:23:01.610 --> 00:23:06.460
<i>to keep someone who's not a prodigy 
or a superhuman like me going.</i>

00:23:15.040 --> 00:23:19.070
Everyone, I apologize for doing this
while you're eating,

00:23:19.070 --> 00:23:23.520
but I'd like to let you all know our upcoming 
policies for the Seven-Light Faith,

00:23:23.520 --> 00:23:25.730
the governing body of the Elm Republic.

00:23:25.730 --> 00:23:26.860
Is that all right?

00:23:26.860 --> 00:23:27.550
Of course.

00:23:26.860 --> 00:23:28.280
Yeah.

00:23:27.550 --> 00:23:28.280
Yes.

00:23:29.510 --> 00:23:32.890
Very well. Then...

00:23:33.510 --> 00:23:39.230
<b>High School Prodigies Have It Easy
Even In Another World!</b>
